---

<section class="relative py-24 md:py-32 bg-[#0B0E14] overflow-hidden text-[#f5f5f5]">
  
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full overflow-hidden pointer-events-none">
    <div class="absolute -top-[20%] -left-[10%] w-[50vw] h-[50vw] rounded-full bg-[#0F172A] blur-[100px] opacity-40"></div>
    
    <div class="absolute -bottom-[20%] -right-[10%] w-[40vw] h-[40vw] rounded-full bg-[#f5bd02] blur-[120px] opacity-[0.05]"></div>
    
    <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[80%] h-[80%] rounded-full bg-[#0B0E14] blur-[50px] opacity-80"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
    
    <div class="text-center mb-16 md:mb-24 space-y-4">
      <span class="text-[#f5bd02] font-pangram text-xs  tracking-[0.2em]">Got Questions?</span>
      <h2 class="font-monument text-3xl md:text-5xl  leading-tight">
        Frequently asked <br /> <span class="text-transparent stroke-white" style="-webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.5);">Questions</span>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      
      <div class="faq-item border border-white/10 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] backdrop-blur-sm overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/20">
        <button class="faq-toggle w-full flex justify-between items-center p-6 md:p-8 text-left focus:outline-none group">
          <span class="font-pangram-bold text-lg md:text-xl text-white group-hover:text-[#f5bd02] transition-colors">1. Do you design logos?</span>
          <div class="icon relative w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="absolute w-full h-[2px] bg-white group-hover:bg-[#f5bd02] transition-colors"></span>
            <span class="absolute w-[2px] h-full bg-white group-hover:bg-[#f5bd02] transition-all duration-300 rotate-90 scale-100"></span>
          </div>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content grid grid-rows-[0fr] transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-out">
          <div class="overflow-hidden">
            <p class="font-pangram text-white/60 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed px-6 pb-8 md:px-8">
              Yes, Helm is a full-service design agency with a dedicated branding team that can assist with naming, logo design, brand strategy, brand guidelines, and other branding services. Handling both your website and branding projects under one roof is cost-efficient and ensures that we leverage our comprehensive understanding of your brand to deliver cohesive and impactful results.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item border border-white/10 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] backdrop-blur-sm overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/20">
        <button class="faq-toggle w-full flex justify-between items-center p-6 md:p-8 text-left focus:outline-none group">
          <span class="font-pangram-bold text-lg md:text-xl text-white group-hover:text-[#f5bd02] transition-colors">2. How much does a website cost?</span>
          <div class="icon relative w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="absolute w-full h-[2px] bg-white group-hover:bg-[#f5bd02] transition-colors"></span>
            <span class="absolute w-[2px] h-full bg-white group-hover:bg-[#f5bd02] transition-all duration-300 rotate-90 scale-100"></span>
          </div>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content grid grid-rows-[0fr] transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-out">
          <div class="overflow-hidden">
            <p class="font-pangram text-white/60 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed px-6 pb-8 md:px-8">
              The cost of a custom website depends on three main factors: the number of unique landing pages, backend features and integrations. Informational websites with a few landing pages are less expensive and quicker to develop than complex sites with custom backend features, such as job portals or marketplaces.<br><br> Use our <a href="/calculator" class="text-[#f5bd02] underline hover:text-white transition-colors">Project Calculator</a> to get a quick estimate right now.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item border border-white/10 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] backdrop-blur-sm overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/20">
        <button class="faq-toggle w-full flex justify-between items-center p-6 md:p-8 text-left focus:outline-none group">
          <span class="font-pangram-bold text-lg md:text-xl text-white group-hover:text-[#f5bd02] transition-colors">3. How long does it take to design a website?</span>
          <div class="icon relative w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="absolute w-full h-[2px] bg-white group-hover:bg-[#f5bd02] transition-colors"></span>
            <span class="absolute w-[2px] h-full bg-white group-hover:bg-[#f5bd02] transition-all duration-300 rotate-90 scale-100"></span>
          </div>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content grid grid-rows-[0fr] transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-out">
          <div class="overflow-hidden">
            <p class="font-pangram text-white/60 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed px-6 pb-8 md:px-8">
              Usually 2 to 4 weeks for a standard website. If you need a big app or a complex brand, it might take about 2 months allowing time for detailed design and client feedback. Larger, more complex sites with advanced features may require more than 2 months. This timeline includes thorough design of key pages and a user testing phase to ensure optimal performance.. We work fast, but we never rush quality.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item border border-white/10 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] backdrop-blur-sm overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/20">
        <button class="faq-toggle w-full flex justify-between items-center p-6 md:p-8 text-left focus:outline-none group">
          <span class="font-pangram-bold text-lg md:text-xl text-white group-hover:text-[#f5bd02] transition-colors">4. Do you make mobile apps?</span>
          <div class="icon relative w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="absolute w-full h-[2px] bg-white group-hover:bg-[#f5bd02] transition-colors"></span>
            <span class="absolute w-[2px] h-full bg-white group-hover:bg-[#f5bd02] transition-all duration-300 rotate-90 scale-100"></span>
          </div>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content grid grid-rows-[0fr] transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-out">
          <div class="overflow-hidden">
            <p class="font-pangram text-white/60 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed px-6 pb-8 md:px-8">
             Yes, we build apps for both iPhone and Android. Our process covers everything from the start to the finish. First, we plan how the app works so it is easy for people to use. Then, we design how it looks. Finally, our team writes the code to make it fast and smooth. We also make sure the app works on different screen sizes, like small phones and large tablets. If you already have a website, we can even build an app that connects to it so everything stays updated.            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item border border-white/10 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] backdrop-blur-sm overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/20">
        <button class="faq-toggle w-full flex justify-between items-center p-6 md:p-8 text-left focus:outline-none group">
          <span class="font-pangram-bold text-lg md:text-xl text-white group-hover:text-[#f5bd02] transition-colors">5. What do I need to start?</span>
          <div class="icon relative w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="absolute w-full h-[2px] bg-white group-hover:bg-[#f5bd02] transition-colors"></span>
            <span class="absolute w-[2px] h-full bg-white group-hover:bg-[#f5bd02] transition-all duration-300 rotate-90 scale-100"></span>
          </div>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content grid grid-rows-[0fr] transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-out">
          <div class="overflow-hidden">
            <p class="font-pangram text-white/60 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed px-6 pb-8 md:px-8">
              Just your idea! If you have logos or text, that's great. If not, don't worry. We can help you write the content and create the designs from scratch.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

            <div class="faq-item border border-white/10 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] backdrop-blur-sm overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/20">
        <button class="faq-toggle w-full flex justify-between items-center p-6 md:p-8 text-left focus:outline-none group">
          <span class="font-pangram-bold text-lg md:text-xl text-white group-hover:text-[#f5bd02] transition-colors">6. How can you help me generate leads after my website is launched?</span>
          <div class="icon relative w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="absolute w-full h-[2px] bg-white group-hover:bg-[#f5bd02] transition-colors"></span>
            <span class="absolute w-[2px] h-full bg-white group-hover:bg-[#f5bd02] transition-all duration-300 rotate-90 scale-100"></span>
          </div>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content grid grid-rows-[0fr] transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-out">
          <div class="overflow-hidden">
            <p class="font-pangram text-white/60 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed px-6 pb-8 md:px-8">
               We provide hands-on digital marketing that takes the work off your plate. Our team handles the full production cycle: we come to your location for professional photo and video shoots, create high-end content, and provide complete social media management. From filming and editing to posting and community engagement, we manage your online presence to drive growth and lead generation.            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item border border-white/10 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] backdrop-blur-sm overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/20">
        <button class="faq-toggle w-full flex justify-between items-center p-6 md:p-8 text-left focus:outline-none group">
          <span class="font-pangram-bold text-lg md:text-xl text-white group-hover:text-[#f5bd02] transition-colors">7. what does helm stand for?</span>
          <div class="icon relative w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="absolute w-full h-[2px] bg-white group-hover:bg-[#f5bd02] transition-colors"></span>
            <span class="absolute w-[2px] h-full bg-white group-hover:bg-[#f5bd02] transition-all duration-300 rotate-90 scale-100"></span>
          </div>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content grid grid-rows-[0fr] transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-out">
          <div class="overflow-hidden">
            <p class="font-pangram text-white/60 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed px-6 pb-8 md:px-8">
              Helm actually stands for the amharic word ህልም which means "Dreams". We chose it because it represents our mission making the dreams of our clients a reality, and also because it's a unique and memorable name that reflects our Ethiopian roots.  
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>


      

    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Simple Accordion Logic
    const toggles = document.querySelectorAll('.faq-toggle');

    toggles.forEach(toggle => {
      toggle.addEventListener('click', () => {
        // Toggle the 'active' state on the clicked item
        const content = toggle.nextElementSibling;
        const iconVerticalLine = toggle.querySelector('.icon span:nth-child(2)');
        
        // Check if it's already open
        const isOpen = content.style.gridTemplateRows === '1fr';

        // Close all others (Accordion style)
        document.querySelectorAll('.faq-content').forEach(c => c.style.gridTemplateRows = '0fr');
        document.querySelectorAll('.icon span:nth-child(2)').forEach(s => s.style.transform = 'rotate(90deg)');
        
        // If it wasn't open, open it now
        if (!isOpen) {
          content.style.gridTemplateRows = '1fr';
          iconVerticalLine.style.transform = 'rotate(0deg)'; // Turn + into -
        }
      });
    });
  </script>
</section>
